&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;PHENOGY AG is a leading innovator of battery energy storage technologies and solutions for the green electrification of the planet. Our team members work on future-proof and sustainable battery systems that are powerful, safe, and robust – with circularity as a central principle. Our technology partner network spans leading battery research institutes. PHENOGY is an environmentally and socially conscious enterprise. We are committed to fostering prosperity for the people and our planet, ensuring sustainable growth – starting in the area of our greatest expertise and impact: energy storage solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We energize the future.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;PHENOGY is seeking curious, entrepreneurial-minded energy pioneers to help shape our vision, systems, and growth; playing a key-role as we launch into our ambitious future. If you’re inspired by our mission, values, and drive to change how we energize the future — we’d love your application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;PHENOGY is a dynamic, fast-growing company specializing in innovative energy storage solutions. We develop, manufacture, and distribute advanced energy storage systems worldwide.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scriptor-paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Head of IT, you will ensure that Phenogy&#39;s IT-Technology foundation is secure, reliable, scalable, and capable of supporting rapid international growth. You will own the company&#39;s core IT operations, infrastructure, enterprise applications, cybersecurity, workplace technology, and service delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role focuses on operational excellence and business enablement. You will ensure that employees, strategic partners on the supply-chain as well as on the sales-channel side, manufacturing operations, and commercial teams can work effectively through robust technology platforms while maintaining high standards of security, compliance, and service quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Your tasks &amp;amp; responsibilities:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute Phenogy&#39;s global IT roadmap, ensuring stable and scalable technology operations across Switzerland, Germany, the United States, Singapore and future locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own enterprise applications and business systems, including ERP, collaboration platforms, identity management, endpoint management, and future MES integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain secure, cloud-based infrastructure and workplace technology environments that support global collaboration and operational continuity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cybersecurity, information security, risk management, business continuity, disaster recovery, and compliance initiatives aligned with industry best practices and future certifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage external IT service providers, technology vendors, MSPs, and cybersecurity partners while ensuring service quality, performance, and cost efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead the internal IT organization, including IT Operations, Service Management, and Cybersecurity capabilities, while defining future sourcing and staffing strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish IT governance, service management processes, SLAs, asset management, and operational KPIs to support a growing international organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Operations, Supply Chain, PMO, Quality, Finance, and Commercial functions to ensure technology effectively supports business execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Must have&#39;s:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Several years of leadership experience in IT, Infrastructure, Enterprise Applications, or Technology Operations within manufacturing, industrial, energy, or technology-driven environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience managing enterprise applications, cloud infrastructure, cybersecurity, networks, and global technology operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing and supporting ERP environments and business-critical systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of cybersecurity frameworks, IT governance, risk management, and compliance requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage external service providers, technology vendors, and outsourcing partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen with the ability to translate operational requirements into scalable technology solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in English; German a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice to have&#39;s:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting international manufacturing operations and global supply chains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Microsoft Dynamics, MES environments, or industrial IoT integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of ISO 27001, NIST, TISAX, or similar security frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience scaling technology operations in high-growth organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to renewable energy, battery systems, or industrial technology environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Technopark Lucerne with remote and home-office opportunities or Bremen, Germany&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel Readiness&lt;/strong&gt;: 20-30%&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workload&lt;/strong&gt;: 100%&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports &lt;/strong&gt;: COO&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Join a high-caliber environment that enables you to develop your full potential, shape your job, and take ownership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Participate in the development of PHENOGY and inspire the world to transition to sustainable energy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Become part of our eco-passionate expert team - a first-class team all around.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Benefit from flexible work hours as well as remote and on-site working in a modern sustainable office&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Enjoy various events, an amazing coffee machine, and the occasional coffee from our CEO (acting Barista)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;At PHENOGY, we highly value diversity, equality, and inclusion. It makes our company stronger. &lt;strong&gt;Our philosophy: one mindset, many minds.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
